<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_793_2121.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Erenvest</unclear>, from, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuersichtig</unclear>, ersam und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyß</unclear>, sonders
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guenstig</unclear> lieb herren und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guett</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fruendt</unclear>, min <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fruentlich</unclear>
<lb n="3"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guettwillig</unclear> dienst sind <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uech</unclear>, mit erbietung aller Eren
<lb n="4"/>liebs und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guets</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">yedersit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuevor</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bereÿtt</unclear>. Nach dem sich
<lb n="5"/>nun ein langwiriger span gehalten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwueschent</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Junckher</unclear>
<lb n="6"/>Wolff von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Salchenried</unclear></persName> genant <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Cruebel</unclear></persName> vogt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zu</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuessach</unclear></placeName>, und dem herren von Beckenstein von <placeName resp="#ner">Augspurg</placeName>,
<lb n="8"/>wie yr dessen (als ich one <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwyffel</unclear>) nun mer zum theil
<lb n="9"/>gnuogsam <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bericht</unclear> sind. Darinne ich beid <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">theylen</unclear>, als
<lb n="10"/>umb den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">houpthandel</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">yrs</unclear> haltend spans der ansprach
<lb n="11"/>halb, so gesagter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Junckher</unclear> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Salchenried</unclear> wider denn
<lb n="12"/>herren von Beckenstein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuert</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermoeg</unclear> miner gnedigen
<lb n="13"/>herren der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">aeyt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">oerter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jungst</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">usgangen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abscheid</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><placeName resp="#ner">Baden</placeName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verguenstigett</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wytter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kuntschft</unclear>. rechtlicher
<lb n="15"/>form <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> zenemen etc. Und ouch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßhalb</unclear> uff
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anrueffen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Junckher</unclear> Wolffen von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Salchenrieds</unclear>, ich dem
<lb n="17"/>herren von Beckenstein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bÿ</unclear> eignem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leueffers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">botten</unclear> genn
<lb n="18"/>Augspurg <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geschriben</unclear>, das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Junckher</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Wolff</persName> oder
<lb n="19"/>sin anwalt uff <date resp="#ner">yetz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noechst</unclear> Zinstag in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">oster</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">firttagen</unclear></date>
<lb n="20"/>by <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uech</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erschinen</unclear> werd, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begren</unclear> in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beruerter</unclear> sach
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kuntschft</unclear>. wider <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ynne</unclear> rechtlich uff zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">triben</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moege</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßhalb</unclear> er von <placeName resp="#ner">Beckenstein</placeName>, daselbst uff ernempten tag
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erschinen</unclear>, oder sin anwalt dahin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schicken</unclear>, dan der
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Junckher</unclear> von <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Salchenried</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ÿme</unclear> damit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> innemen
<lb n="25"/>soelicher <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kuntschft</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verkuent</unclear> haben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">woelle</unclear> etc. Langt
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßhalb</unclear> an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uech</unclear> min <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guenstig</unclear> herren, min <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fruentlich</unclear>
<lb n="27"/>und dienstlich bitt, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ÿr</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">woellen</unclear> dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begerenden</unclear>
<lb n="28"/>harinne <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kuntschft</unclear>. der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">warheitt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuerderung</unclear>
<lb n="29"/>des rechten, nach form der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rechten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guettigklich</unclear> gevolgen
<lb n="30"/>lassen und schrifftlichen mit theylen, wie dan
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_793_2122.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="31"/>Ich one zwyffel ir die gerechtigkeit zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuerdern</unclear> gantz
<lb n="32"/>wol geneigt. Mich hiemit in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uewern</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diensth</unclear> beuelchende,
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Gott</unclear> bittend er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uech</unclear> in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">siner</unclear> gnad <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">glueckselicklich</unclear>
<lb n="34"/>bewaren <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">woelle</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Dath</unclear> zuo <origPlace ref="stadtasg-places-88" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Rinegck</origPlace> <origDate when="1559" resp="#ner">uff oster samp=
<lb n="35"/>stag anno <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dni</unclear> etc. 1559</origDate>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">U</unclear>. E. W.
<lb n="37"/>williger
<lb n="38"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Johans <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Gißler</unclear> von Ury</persName>
<lb n="39"/>ietz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landtuogt</unclear> im
<lb n="40"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-64" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Rinthal</placeName>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_793_2123.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_793_2124.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="41"/>Den erenvesten fromen fürsicht=
<lb n="42"/>igen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wÿsen</unclear> herren <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">burger=
<lb n="43"/>meister und rhat der stat <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sant</unclear>
<lb n="44"/>Gallen</orgName>, minen sonders günstigen
<lb n="45"/>lieben herren und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guote</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründ</unclear>.
</p>
